---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13615550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(361) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Mosquitoes in Yard Victoria TX | Outdoor Mosquito Control" description="Too many mosquitoes in your Victoria, TX yard? Barrier treatments and breeding-site advice help you enjoy outdoor time again.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Mosquitoes in Yard</div>
      <h1>Mosquitoes in the Yard</h1>
      <p>Standing water and dense vegetation create ideal conditions. We reduce the population so evenings outside are enjoyable again.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>Reduce Breeding + Resting Sites</h2>
      <p>Adult mosquitoes rest on foliage during the day. Treating vegetation with a residual product knocks down the local population. Combining that with elimination of standing water gives the best results.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Yard Treatment</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
